---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy" description="How this gallery handles your information.">
  <main class="privacy">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>This gallery is run by a single artist in Calgary, Alberta. It follows Alberta's Personal Information Protection Act (PIPA).</p>
    <h2>What is collected</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Page views:</strong> anonymous counters per painting (no cookies, no fingerprinting).</li>
      <li><strong>Aggregate analytics:</strong> Cloudflare Web Analytics, which sets no cookies and tracks no individuals.</li>
      <li><strong>Inquiries:</strong> the name, email, and message you type into a buy form — used only to reply to you.</li>
    <li><strong>Collector alerts:</strong> if you tap “Notify me”, your browser's push address is stored so new paintings can ping you. Remove it any time with the same button.</li>
    <li><strong>Spam check:</strong> the buy form uses Cloudflare Turnstile, which quietly confirms you're human. No puzzles, no tracking cookies.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What is not collected</h2>
    <p>No accounts, no advertising trackers, no cross-site tracking, no sale of personal information.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>To see or delete an inquiry you sent, or to ask anything about privacy, email the artist and it will be handled personally.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy { max-width: 44rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1rem 1.25rem 4rem; }
</style>
